\par\par \b \uc2 DJ   \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Admits  \highlight22\uc2 Currency Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Rebecca Howard   \par \uc2 387 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Mai 2013\par 09:22\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Newswires English Content\par \uc2 RTNW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON--\b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and would do so again if needed to contain a soaring local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that's dragging on tourism and denting the competitiveness of the nation's agricultural exports.\par \par \uc2 The remarks, by Reserve Bank of Australia Governor \uc2 Graeme Wheeler\uc2 , sent the Kiwi tumbling nearly a cent lower to US$0.8361 from US$0.8460 on Wednesday. The governor also said the Kiwi was "overvalued... perhaps significantly," signaling the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's high level remained a concern.\par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar has risen about 10% in the past year against a basket of major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Official data already shows the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has actively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollars in recent months, but the \uc2 Reserve Bank\uc2  until now hasn't explicitly called it an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "We've indicated on the record that we are prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange rate," Mr. Wheeler said in a testimony to lawmakers. "We would not expect, given the strength of the flows, that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would materially change the level of the exchange rate, but we could take potentially the tops off rallies. And in terms of activity, there has been some."\par \par \uc2 In December, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold nearly NZ$200 million in the most significant sale in nearly four years, official data show. The pace of its sales slowed early this year, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling only NZ$28 million in the first three months of the year combined. The \uc2 Reserve Bank\uc2  is due to release foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  transaction data for April later this month and some analysts say the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have gathered pace again.\par \par \uc2 "Activity may have picked up very recently," Gareth Berry, a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at \uc2 UBS\uc2  said. He added that Mr. Wheeler's remarks Wednesday didn't look like the start of an "aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  campaign."\par \par \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist Stephen Toplis said the market reaction Wednesday was a "storm in a teacup," adding that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was likely to continue selling small amounts of its reserves "as part of their normal \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 " whenever the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose sharply.\par \par \uc2 Write to Rebecca Howard at rebecca.howard@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 08-05-13 0722GMT\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTNW000020130508e958000dv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
