\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-RBNZ  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  to curb NZD as global flood of money raises economic risks\b0\par\par\uc2 786 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Mai 2013\par 02:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * RBNZ confirms has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to lower NZ dollar\par \par \uc2 * Market participants expect biggest NZD selling since mid-2007\par \par \uc2 * Analysts: \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to have limited impact on NZD strength\par \par \uc2 (Adds comment, details)\par \par \uc2 By Gyles Beckford and Naomi Tajitsu\par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON, May 8 (Reuters) - New Zealand's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed selling its own \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for only the second time since the "kiwi" was floated in 1985, reflecting concerns that a flood of global money could undermine a budding economic recovery.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  usually keeps \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  quiet, and its rare admission came after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  surged to 20-month highs of $0.8676 last month, undercutting exporters and pressuring an economy finding its feet after devastating earthquakes in Christchurch in the last two years.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  demonstrated the widespread unease among smaller economies over the impact of massive monetary expansionary campaigns in the United States and Japan.\par \par \uc2 "There has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  ... We've indicated on the record that we are prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange rate," Governor \uc2 Graeme Wheeler\uc2  told a parliamentary committee on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, the Australian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , also grappling with a high-flying \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , cut interest rates to a record-low 2.75 percent.\par \par \uc2 The Australian dollar is not far from 28 year peaks when measured against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is "unusual given the decline in export prices and interest rates," Reserve Bank of Australia Governor Glen Stevens said.\par \par \uc2 The kiwi has surged to similarly uncomfortable levels.\par \par \uc2 In April, when traders suspect the RBNZ conducted its latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the kiwi's trade-weighted index, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  measure closely followed by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , rose to 79.39, a record for the free float era.\par \par \uc2 During the last quarter of 2012 the New Zealand economy grew at its fastest pace in three years. It is expected to show annual growth of about 3 percent for the next couple of years, led by improving domestic demand and the rebuild of earthquake damaged Christchurch.\par \par \uc2 The high \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, is putting pressure on exporters' earnings.\par \par \uc2 Wheeler's comments helped drive down the New Zealand dollar\par \par \uc2 more than half a U.S. cent to a session low, but it is still hovering near a post-float high around $0.8850 hit in August 2011.\par \par \uc2 And market participants believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the RBNZ would do little to weaken the kiwi, which is the 10th most traded \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in global markets.\par \par \uc2 Wheeler admitted as much: "We've also indicated that we would not expect the strength of the flows from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to materially change the exchange rate, although it could potentially take the top off (\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strength)."\par \par \uc2 The message was not lost on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 "What he's doing is talking about tools and waving a stick as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  goes," said Alex Sinton, director, institutional \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2 , global markets at ANZ.\par \par \uc2 ATTRACTIVE YIELDS\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  diversification by sovereign investors and the wall of money unleashed by massive monetary easing campaigns by major central banks have driven the "kiwi" higher.\par \par \uc2 Investors are drawn to its attractive yields, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  expected to raise interest rates from a record low of 2.5 percent in the next year.\par \par \uc2 New Zealand's 10-year bond is currently trading around 3.2 percent, compared with a yield of 1.78 percent for its \uc2 U.S. Treasury\uc2  counterpart.\par \par \uc2 Wheeler told the committee the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  may appreciate more if investors expected the country's economy to outperform, raising expectations of higher rates.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's latest balance sheet, which covers transactions through March, shows scant selling of New Zealand dollars from the bank's reserves during the first three months of the year, after it sold a net NZ$199 million in December.\par \par \uc2 Market participants said that while the RBNZ's selling in April would be higher than the December amount, it would not be on the scale of the RBNZ's last major confirmed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in June-July 2007, when it sold a total of NZ$2.2 billion to stem kiwi strength.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has appeared to have sold the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sporadically since then, but Wednesday's confirmation was only the second time the RBNZ has declared its hand since 2007.\par \par \uc2 "The RBNZ is playing a similar game to many other central banks in attempting to weaken or at least prevent strength in their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," analysts at \uc2 Credit Agricole\uc2  CIB said in a note. "The bottom line is that more smoothing is likely but a significant push to change NZD direction is highly unlikely."\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Gyles Beckford; Editing by Shri Navaratnam)\par \par \uc2 NEWZEALAND-ECONOMY/RBNZ  (UPDATE 2) | ABX | BNX | FUN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130508e9580000u\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 Dollar significantly overvalued, hurting exporters - NZMEA\b0\par\par\uc2 NZ Manufacturers and Exporters Association (NZMEA)   \par \uc2 341 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Mai 2013\par 05:18\par \uc2 Fuseworks Media\par \uc2 FUSMED\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2013. Fuseworks Limited.   \par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBNZ) has admitted to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets responding to the appreciation of our \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , say the \uc2 New Zealand Manufacturers and Exporters Association\uc2  (NZMEA).\par \par \uc2 NZMEA Chief Executive John Walley says, "It is good to see the RBNZ make some moves to lower our \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but they can do much more than "take the top off the rallies". The sharp drop in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  across the board shows just what action from a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can do. If the RBNZ were to commit to a more long term set of actions to bring down the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , we would see a sustained effect on the dollar. This could be achieved through a co-ordinated mix of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , monetary policy and other macro-prudential tools."\par \par \uc2 "We consistently reference the example for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.realeconomy.co.nz/206-rbnz_lessons_from_the_swiss.aspx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Swiss \b  \highlight22Central Bank\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  using the infinite capacity of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to place and enforce a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ceiling."\par \par \uc2 "The \uc2 Reserve Bank of Australia\uc2  (RBA) has also cut a further 25 basis points off its cash rate to a record low 2.75%. They are taking action against the appreciation of their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 "Much of Australia's recent economic success has been built on the back of their strong natural resource based businesses. Now their exporting sector is struggling, largely due to strength of their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 "Why is this important for New Zealand? Australia has been a bright spot for exporters in recent times; meaning businesses exporting to Australia for Australian consumption have been doing okay, compared to those selling into the U.S and Europe. The RBA takes action to lower the pressure on the AUS$ and places upwards pressure on the NZ$; this will hurt New Zealand exporters."\par \par \uc2 "We are pleased to see the \uc2 Reserve Bank of New Zealand\uc2  (RBNZ) commit to putting new tools into place for increasing reserves for high Loan to Value Ratio loans as well as some \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 "Even so, our dollar remains significantly overvalued, hurting exporters."\par \par \uc2 Dokument FUSMED0020130508e95800209\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
