\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: NZ  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Threatens  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  to Curb Kiwi\b0\par\par\uc2 By Rebecca Howard   \par \uc2 505 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 2013\par 07:24\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON--\b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  threatened to take steps to weaken the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as its strength makes it increasingly difficult for the tiny exporting nation to compete in global markets.\par \par \uc2 Reserve Bank of New Zealand Gov. \uc2 Graeme Wheeler\uc2  said Wednesday the New Zealand dollar is "significantly over-valued," and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets "when the circumstances are right". He also said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could use the country's cash rate as a tool to apply downward pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels have become a politically charged issue globally as aggressive monetary policy steps taken by central banks, including the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  and \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2 , have contributed to a sharp appreciation in \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  such as the New Zealand and Australian dollars as foreign investors seek out higher-yielding assets.\par \par \uc2 New Zealand's economy is far from a global powerhouse, but its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  plays an outsize role in the daily \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as one of the 10 most-traded \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the world, according to the \uc2 Bank for International Settlements\uc2 . In 2010, the kiwi accounted for about 1.6% of global \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily turnover.\par \par \uc2 So far in 2013, the kiwi, as it is commonly called, has gained around 1.7%. That makes it one of the best performers among Group of 10 nations when compared with the U.S. dollar. Part of its appeal is that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has kept its benchmark interest rate at 2.5%, attracting yield-hungry investors.\par \par \uc2 Manufacturers and exporters have been lobbying the government to take action as the kiwi's strength undermines the competitiveness of the country's crucial farm exports. Dairy products account for a quarter of the nation's annual exports, valued at around 46 billion New Zealand dollars (US$39 million). Exporters have said that for every 1% increase in the exchange rate, exporters lose around NZ$200 million annually.\par \par \uc2 The kiwi tumbled following Mr. Wheeler's remarks, made at a gathering of exporters in Auckland, and was trading at US$0.8411 at 0438 GMT versus US$0.8469 before the speech.\par \par \uc2 Still, some analysts were skeptical about whether Mr Wheeler would follow through on his tough rhetoric.\par \par \uc2 Annette Beacher, the Singapore-based head of Asia-Pacific research for \uc2 TD Securities\uc2 , said Mr. Wheeler is "toothless tiger" and "highly unlikely" to cut the cash rate or directly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Neither move would have much impact on the kiwi, she added.\par \par \uc2 Policymakers pledged during a weekend meeting of \uc2 Group of 20\uc2  industrial and developing nations in Moscow to ensure that monetary policy is focused on price stability and growth, rather than on weakening \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as countries globally try to devalue their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  because of falling global trade.\par \par \uc2 "There are no simple solutions available to the \uc2 Reserve Bank\uc2  on the exchange rate challenges we face," Mr. Wheeler said.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    Write to Rebecca Howard at rebecca.howard@wsj.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 20-02-13 0624GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130220e92k0006c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
