\par\par \b \uc2 N.Z.  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Kept Up Passive  \highlight22\uc2 Currency Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Lucy Craymer   \par \uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Januar 2013\par 05:44\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON--\b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued to apply subtle downward pressure on the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by reducing its New Zealand dollar holdings for the second straight month in December.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of New Zealand\uc2 , or RBNZ, sold 200 million New Zealand dollars (US$168 million) last month after selling NZ$66 million in November in the first significant sales of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  since March 2008.\par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar has remained elevated in recent months, with investors buying the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on promising growth signs as agricultural commodity prices stay firm, and earthquake reconstruction work looking like giving a boost to the economy this year. But as with Australia, New Zealand's strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is hurting many companies reliant on converting foreign income.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is "not trying to influence the level of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said \uc2 Bank of New Zealand\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist \uc2 Mike Jones\uc2 . "They're just leaning against the wind."\par \par \uc2 The RBNZ seldom actively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, and Mr. Jones said that while the scale of the buying was limited, the moves were more a "signalling device"--a way for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to indicate that the Kiwi was overvalued and that it would like it to move lower.\par \par \uc2 Write to Lucy Craymer at lucy.craymer@wsj.com [ 30-01-13 0444GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130130e91u0005t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
