al policy.\par \par \uc2 "These provide the best framework for achieving stronger growth in output and employment in the longer term," he said.\par \par \uc2 Write to Lucy Craymer at lucy.craymer@wsj.com [ 25-10-12 2038GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020121025e8ap0019o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
