ighlight\uc2  position -- a figure which the RBNZ has said better reflects its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealings -- rose to NZ$2.4 billion from NZ$2.3 billion in August.   \par \par \uc2 The full data is available on the Reserve Bank's website,   {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.rbnz.govt.nz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.rbnz.govt.nz  }}}\uc2  ($1=NZ$1.3) (Reporting by Kazunori Takada, editing by James Thornhill; Reuters Messaging: kazunori.takada.reuters.com@reuters.net; +64-4-471-4232))   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-RBNZ/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ND|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020071030e3au0008i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
