\par\par \b \uc2 RBNZ Sold NZ$138M In Aug Vs NZ$1.49B In July   \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 September 2007\par 05:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank of New Zealand sold a net NZ$138 million in the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in August, data issued Thursday by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  showed.   \par \par \uc2 A month earlier, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had sold NZ$1.49 billion.   \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ data also showed the bank's net short \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  position rose to NZ$2.56 billion from NZ$2.26 billion in July.   \par \par \uc2 The August figures don't provide complete data on the amount the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, as the numbers include liabilities of the New Zealand Debt Management Office.   \par \par \uc2 The sales figure in July indicated an escalation in the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market after the unprecedented action June 11 to sell the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar.   \par \par \uc2 The June 11 \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  attempted to knock back the high-flying local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  - the first such action since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated in 1985. Traders said the bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on at least two more occasions in June, and three times more in July.   \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar surged to a 25-year peak of US$0.8110 in late July before falling back due to concerns about a global credit crunch.