\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-NZ cenbank sold net NZ$702 mln in June   \b0\par\par\uc2 487 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 August 2007\par 05:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  (Adds analyst comment)   \par \par \uc2  WELLINGTON, Aug 6 (Reuters) - The Reserve Bank of New Zealand (RBNZ) sold NZ$702 million ($536 million) of New Zealand dollars on a net basis on the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market during June, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data released on Monday showed.   \par \par \uc2  The RBNZ was believed to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at least three times on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in June to sell the New Zealand dollar as part of its strategy to limit the rise in the kiwi.   \par \par \uc2  The June \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealings compared with a net NZ$58 million bought in May, and a monthly average of NZ$65.6 million bought for the previous 12 months.   \par \par \uc2  It is not a direct and complete indication of the amount spent on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and includes liabilities of the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  government's Debt Management Office. The full data is available on the Reserve Bank of NZ's Web site,   {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.rbnz.govt.nz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.rbnz.govt.nz  }}}\par \par \uc2  Analysts said the figure was similar to what the market had expected. They also suspected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had continued to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in July.   \par \par \uc2  "We expect the Reserve Bank to continue to actively go short the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the next few months," said Shamubeel Eaqub, director of investment research at  \uc2 Goldman Sachs JBWere.\par \par \uc2  "We think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  tends to have only a short-term impact and we don't think this will be the catalyst for a sustained depreciation in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."   \par \par \uc2  In June, the kiwi traded in a $0.7368 to $0.7687 range, according to Reuters data. It hit a post-float 22 year high of $0.8110 <NZD=D4> on July 24.   \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was little moved by the data, trading around $0.7580. So far this year it has gained around 7.5 percent.   \par \par \uc2  In July, the RBNZ said it would refine its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy, with some of its actions becoming more passive as it left a portion of its reserves unhedged, allowing it to more effectively respond to any sharp falls in the New Zealand dollar.   \par \par \uc2  The changes have been seen by analysts as bringing the RBNZ closer into line with broader market practice and similar to the way the Reserve Bank of Australia operates.   \par \par \uc2  The RBNZ can spend as much as it wants in selling the kiwi dollar, but can only book losses of up to NZ$1 billion under an agreement with the government. Analysts have estimated that it might have as much as NZ$10 billion available for such \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is at unjustifiable and exceptional levels given economic fundamentals, when it has a reasonable chance of success, and if it was consistent with its monetary policy aim of price stability.  ($1=NZ$1.31)      \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-RBNZ/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ND|ABN|D|M|ABX|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070806e3860004c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
