\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: NZ Ctrl Bk Plans To Hold Some Unhedged  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Reserves   \b0\par\par\uc2 714 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Juli 2007\par 06:12\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    (Adds detail, analyst comments) \par  \par    By Symon Ross \par    Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said Friday it will hold some foreign reserves on an unhedged basis in future to better enable it defend any sharp falls in the New Zealand dollar.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's latest stance is in contrast to its position over the past 20 years, where foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  assets have been fully matched by foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  liabilities. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  practice would also bring it in line with what its counterparts around the world do.   \par \par \uc2 A part of the Reserve Bank's foreign reserves portfolio will now be funded in New Zealand dollars rather than in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 "In crisis situations it is of paramount importance that the Bank retains access to foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. With a portion of our reserves no longer borrowed from abroad, but funded internally, we will become less dependent on international capital markets in times of crisis," RBNZ Governor Alan Bollard said.   \par \par \uc2 Bollard said the move to a "more conventional approach" to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  management would give the bank a more effective means of responding to crisis situations involving sharp falls in the New Zealand dollar.   \par \par \uc2 The governor said the use of unhedged reserves would be less costly and cause less risk than using hedged reserves.   \par \par \uc2 "Unhedged foreign reserves provide a more effective form of insurance against a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis," Bollard said.   \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ confirmed that it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on June 11 to sell \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollars for the first time since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated in 1985. It has been rumored to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a number of occasions since then to cap the Kiwi's gains, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't confirm this.   \par \par \uc2 Since June 11 the New Zealand dollar has hit a series of new post-float highs and touched US$0.7881 last week.   \par \par \uc2 The local unit had slipped to US$0.7834 by 0400 GMT from US$0.7864 prior to the release of the RBNZ's statement. Dealers attributed the weakness to the bank saying it still plans to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reaches excessive levels.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    No Change To \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Criteria \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Greg Gibbs, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist at ABN AMRO, said the announcement didn't mean a great deal as the RBNZ didn't change its criteria for \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "This is just about how they account for \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . They are now doing it just like every other \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , by running up reserve and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  forwards when they sell New Zealand dollars and running them down when they buy New Zealand dollars," Gibbs said.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "This statement has no implications for rate decisions or the timing of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ."   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 New Zealand\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  head of market economics Stephen Toplis said the announcement made sense, but shouldn't move the market much.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Clearly if you're going to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to try and move a \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  around or build up reserves, it doesn't make an awful lot of sense to hedge them, because you're giving an opposite transaction that defeats the purpose," Toplis said.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The statement did, however, substantiate the view that the bank prefers to build up reserves in foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  assets at a time when the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is unusually high, rather than \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to force it to a particular level, he said.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The RBNZ said in its statement that overt \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  intended to affect the exchange rate directly may still occur but that it will also more gradually accumulate or reduce its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  position when the exchange rate is at extreme and unjustified levels.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Bollard said he didn't expect the bank's more passive transactions to affect the exchange rate directly, but these would continue to be used to give "concrete signals" when the RBNZ thinks the exchange rate is overvalued or undervalued.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "That may indirectly affect the exchange rate by discouraging speculators from pushing the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to extreme levels," Bollard said.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  also expects greater variability in its net income from its more open \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  position as a result of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  gains and losses.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Symon Ross, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; symon.ross@dowjones.com [ 13-07-07 0412GMT ]   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070713e37d0003o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
