\par\par \b \uc2 NZ dollar advances to 22-year highs on yield buying   \b0\par\par\uc2 453 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Juli 2007\par 23:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON, July 2 (Reuters) - The New Zealand dollar <NZD=> strengthened to 22-year post-float highs on Monday, lifted by steady buying by Japanese investors seeking high yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 The kiwi touched $0.7760 <NZD=D>, its highest level since it was floated in 1985, and traders said the risks were pointed to the upside given the possibility the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could raise interest rates again.   \par \par \uc2 "We see risks NZD will test $0.80 sooner rather than later," said  \uc2 RBC Capital Markets\uc2  senior \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist Sue Trinh.   \par \par \uc2 At 0525 GMT the kiwi was at $0.7752/62 from $0.7691/01 in late local trade on Friday.   \par \par \uc2 Traders said buying related to Japanese investment trusts was a key driver for the kiwi's rise, sending the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  up to a 20-year peak of 95.55 yen <NZDJPY=R>.   \par \par \uc2 The yen slipped after the Bank of Japan's key business sentiment tankan survey came in line with economists' forecast, suggesting the country's relatively low interest rates would rise only gradually.   \par \par \uc2 On a trade-weighted basis, the New Zealand dollar also hit an all-time high of 75.19 <=NZD>.   \par \par \uc2 With no significant local data due until NZ Institute of Economic Research's quarterly survey of business opinion on July 10, the kiwi's short-term direction will likely be determined by offshore factors.   \par \par \uc2 Traders speculate the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar's strength, although the impact was likely to be limited.   \par \par \uc2 "RBNZ's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  efforts are increasingly seen as futile, and the market is seriously underestimating the risk of further RBNZ tightening this cycle," said Trinh.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stepped in to sell the kiwi on three occasions since June 11, when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the first time since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated.   \par \par \uc2 Some players think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday when U.S. markets will be closed for a public holiday. The RBNZ has chosen to enter the market at times when it has been in a slow trading period, such as market holidays.   \par \par \uc2 Most economists in a Reuters poll think the RBNZ will not raise interest rates further after lifting them by a total of 75 basis points this year, with a median risk for a rise to 8.25 percent at its next review put at around 30 percent.   \par \par \uc2 New Zealand bonds were slightly firmer, in line after U.S. Treasuries. The yield on the benchmark NZ 10-year government bond <NZG1217=RNZL> nudged down to 6.70 percent.   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-NEWZEALAND-DOLLAR (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|ND|ABX|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070704e371001az\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
