\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  To Sell NZD Is An Ongoing Process -RBNZ   \b0\par\par\uc2 528 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juni 2007\par 06:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par   (Adds details, context and NZD level.) \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 New Zealand\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Wednesday said that its recent unprecedented \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to sell the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  didn't run counter to the bank's monetary policy objectives.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ, which \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  June 11 to cap the high-flying \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar for the first time since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated in 1985, said that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is an "ongoing process."   \par \par \uc2 The bank said in a statement that it won't comment publicly on specific \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  activities, but added that it will only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when it considers the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar at exceptional levels and unjustified by economic fundamentals.   \par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  operates at the margin, affecting the balance of demand and supply for the New Zealand dollar; it can have an immediate downward impact on the exchange rate as it did on June 11," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said.   \par \par \uc2 The June 11 \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  sent the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar down by nearly 2% from around US$0.7630. Since then, traders say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had apparently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice to kneecap the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  with little success.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose to a fresh 25-year peak of US$0.7692 in the overnight session, and was quoted at US$0.7652 at 0340 GMT.   \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ said its action to sell the Kiwi wasn't an attempt to defend a particular level of the exchange rate.   \par \par \uc2 "Rather it sends a signal that, in the bank's view, the exchange rate is out of alignment with the economic fundamentals.   \par \par \uc2 "Those speculating in the New Zealand dollar need to be aware that the exchange rate isn't a one-way bet; they need to be cautious," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said.   \par \par \uc2 New Zealand's interest rates - the second highest in the developed world after Iceland - have attracted inflows in carry trade, when investors borrow in low-yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , such as the yen, to invest in high-yielding ones.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said its attempts to lower the New Zealand dollar don't run counter to its monetary policy objectives.   \par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is about seeking to moderate the trend in the exchange rate and rebalancing monetary policy pressure.   \par \par \uc2 "It does not fundamentally alter monetary policy and does not signal a future easing of conditions," the bank said.   \par \par \uc2 Many economists had questioned the bank's June 11 \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a time when it was raising interest rates, saying that the RBNZ was sending mixed signals to the market.   \par \par \uc2 However, in its statement, the RBNZ reiterated that the outlook for interest rates will depend on how inflation pressures evolve over coming months. "Evidence that inflation pressures are abating will be an important step in seeing the exchange rate return to more sustainable levels," the bank said.   \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ raised the Official Cash Rate by a quarter percentage point each in March, April and June to a record high 8.00%, aiming to knock back demand pressures and cool persistently strong inflation.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Shri Navaratnam, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; shri.navaratnam@dowjones.com \par    -Edited by Roger Ng \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 27-06-07 0400GMT ]   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070627e36r0004a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
