\par\par \b \uc2 RPT- \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Low yield keeps yen near 4-1/2-yr trough vs dollar   \b0\par\par\uc2 By Chikako Mogi   \par \uc2 533 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juni 2007\par 07:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, June 21 (Reuters) - The yen hung near a 4-1/2-year low versus the dollar on Thursday, weighed down as investors continued to use the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy higher-yielding units such as the New Zealand dollar in carry trades.   \par \par \uc2 The kiwi was also closing in on a 22-year peak of $0.7640 hit earlier in the month and near the levels when the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  first confirmed it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week.   \par \par \uc2 The market is testing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's will to step in and stem the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise, and although \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fears may slow the pace of the kiwi's ascent, the country's high interest rates are expected to keep it strengthening, traders said.   \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar was up 0.4 percent at $0.7620.   \par \par \uc2 The yen drifted away from a record low against the euro but traders said it was only a matter of time before the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  scaled a new high against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 "The basic trend of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  with prospects of rising interest rates strengthening remains intact," said Nobuo Ibaraki, a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at Nomura Trust and Banking.   \par \par \uc2 The Bank of Japan is expected to boost interest rates as early as August, but the interest rate differential with other countries is still wide enough to feed Japanese investor appetite for higher-yielding foreign assets, he said.   \par \par \uc2 "Because the yen's slide has been rapid, the market is expected to move sideways for now given a lack of major data or events. The yen's weakening trend will likely continue as there appears to be no clear bottom," Ibaraki said.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar was up 0.15 percent at 123.63 yen and just off a peak of 123.76 yen struck earlier in the week on electronic trading platform EBS, the highest since December 2002.   \par \par \uc2 The yen has lost about 2 percent against the dollar in about two weeks. Traders said a break above 124 yen may take some time but support at 123 yen looked firm.   \par \par \uc2 The euro was little changed at 165.58 yen moving away from the all-time high of 166.12 yen hit on EBS earlier in the week.   \par \par \uc2 The single European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  inched down 0.1 percent to $1.3390.   \par \par \uc2 Minutes from a Bank of England policy meeting in June released on Wednesday showed that BoE Governor Mervyn King and three other Monetary Policy Committee members opposed keeping interest rates steady at 5.5 percent but were outvoted by the remaining five members.   \par \par \uc2 Market players took that to suggest the BoE could raise interest rates as early as next month.   \par \par \uc2 Sterling rose across the board, hitting a fresh 15-year high against the yen.   \par \par \uc2 "The market remains focused on the direction of interest rates, with investors favouring \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  with an outlook of monetary tightening, such as sterling," said a trader at a big Japanese bank.   \par \par \uc2 The pound was at $1.9914 and 246.15 yen.   \par \par \uc2 The Australian dollar was up 0.06 percent at $0.8439   \par \par \uc2 LANGEN|GNN|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070621e36l000a5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
