\par\par \b \uc2 NZ Dlr Ends Slightly Up; Targets Higher Despite RBNZ Threat   \b0\par\par\uc2 482 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Juni 2007\par 07:36\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                           Close        Change \par  NZD/USD                  0.7554       +0.0007 \par  NZD/AUD                  0.8962       +0.0002 \par  July 2009 Bond           7.270%       -3.0 bps \par  December 2017 Bond       6.785%       -2.0 bps \par  10-Year U.S. Spread      +164.0 bps   +4.0 bps \par  90-Day Bank Bill         8.32%        -1.0 bp \par  \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--The New Zealand dollar finished solidly bid Tuesday a day after the nation's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reportedly \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  for the second time in a week to sell the strong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dealers say the Kiwi continues to target higher ranges despite the threat of further action by the Reserve Bank of New Zealand, and believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will remain supported above US$0.7500.   \par \par \uc2 "The RBNZ's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't really done much to dent the Kiwi," said John Clarke, director of treasury services at investment bank Bancorp Treasury. "As long as Japanese interest rates are low and our rates look like they could go higher, you are likely to see demand for carry trades continue."   \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar finished Tuesday's trade near levels where dealers said the RBNZ had apparently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday morning to sell the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 A government official told Dow Jones Newswires on Monday that the RBNZ had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, adding that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was keen to knock back any renewed upward momentum in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 The reported selling of the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar came after last week's unprecedented \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  - the first since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was freely floated in March 1985.   \par \par \uc2 However, many market observers believe the RBNZ is fighting a stiff battle with demand for carry trades - where investors borrow in low-yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to invest in higher-yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  - continuing to drive the Kiwi higher.   \par \par \uc2 This demand has pushed the Kiwi up against the yen, which was quoted at Y93.38 versus Y93.13 in early trade.   \par \par \uc2 Brown Brothers Harriman\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist Marc Chandler said in a report that the RBNZ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has little merit and shows no signs of succeeding.   \par \par \uc2 "When push turns to shove, interest rates are a more important consideration to the markets than RBNZ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said.   \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ earlier this month surprised markets by raising interest rates for the third successive time this year to a record high 8.00%. Economists say persistent inflation pressures meant that a further hike can't be ruled out before year-end.   \par \par \uc2 Government bond prices closed modestly better bid, tracking higher U.S. Treasurys overnight. Some receiving interest also pulled swap rates down.   \par \par \uc2 Traders expect the bond and swap market to be influenced by offshore events due to a thin local data calendar.   \par \par \uc2 -By Shri Navaratnam, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; shri.navaratnam@dowjones.com   \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Michael Kitchen [ 19-06-07 0536GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1062 20711 4171   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070619e36j0004y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
