\par\par \b \uc2 NZ dollar in a tight range on quiet trading   \b0\par\par\uc2 321 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 2007\par 23:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON, June 19 (Reuters) - The New Zealand dollar <NZD=> stayed in a tight range on Tuesday, as the market largely ignored the potential for further \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 The kiwi ended slightly higher on a quiet day where there was no real direction for the market, Westpac \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Strategist Michael Gordon said.   \par \par \uc2 "The kiwi has done well when it's not seeing strong buying, so it doesn't bode well for how effective \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be if you do see a pick-up in demand," Gordon said.   \par \par \uc2 In early trade on Monday the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  was believed to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell the kiwi -- its second move in a week -- in an effort to bring the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down.   \par \par \uc2 At 0520 GMT the kiwi was at $0.7552/55, up from $0.7541/45 in late local trading on Monday, and similar to the pre-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level from early Monday trade. It held a $0.7533 to $0.7554 range in local trade.   \par \par \uc2 A Reuters poll shows the dollar is seen peaking within a few months before easing in 2008 as a weakening economy causes the Reserve Bank is expected to start lowering interest rates.   \par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is one of those things that affect sentiment rather than materially impacting the real economy," BNZ \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist Danica Hampton said.   \par \par \uc2 The market was cynical about the timing of the suspected second \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Gordon said, as it occurred when \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the only active trading market.   \par \par \uc2 "They've never really had to deal with offshore traders trying to take them on so far," Gordon said.   \par \par \uc2 The benchmark NZ December 2017 bond <NZG1217=RNZL> firmed, with yields down slightly to 6.78 percent, in line with U.S. treasury increases ahead of key inflation data.   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-NEWZEALAND-DOLLAR (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|ND|ABX|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070621e36i0027s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
