\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Govt Source: RBNZ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  To Sell NZ Dlrs Mon Morning   \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 2007\par 02:36\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2007, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--A New Zealand government official said Monday the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier in the day to sell the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 The government official, who spoke on condition of anonymity, said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is keen to cap any momentum in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  toward 76 U.S. cents.   \par \par \uc2 'I can confirm that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  this morning, it was modest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  if you like, the (RBNZ) wants to hurt any rallies toward 76 cents,' the source said.   \par \par \uc2 When asked if the RBNZ would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again, he said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is keen to keep the New Zealand dollar closer to US$0.7500.   \par \par \uc2 'There is no set policy on this (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), but they seem to be very uncomfortable on any indication the market may resume the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rally,' he added.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't confirm it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market early Monday, but dealers said the bank was in the market selling the New Zealand dollar.   \par \par \uc2 The action from the RBNZ comes after last week's unprecedented \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  - the first since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated in 1985.   \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar, which fell to US$0.7504 from as high as US$0.7560 earlier this morning, was quoted at US$0.7532 at 2343 GMT.   \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ declined to comment on whether it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 -Shri Navaratnam, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; shri.navaratnam@dowjones.com   \par \par \uc2 -0-    \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020070618e36i0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
