ight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  - the first since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated in 1985.   \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar, which fell to US$0.7504 from as high as US$0.7560 earlier this morning, was quoted at US$0.7532 at 2343 GMT.   \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ declined to comment on whether it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -Shri Navaratnam, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; shri.navaratnam@dowjones.com \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 18-06-07 0000GMT ]   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070617e36h000ga\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
