 US$0.7640 earlier this month, continued to rise.   \par \par \uc2 -By Symon Ross, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; symon.ross@dowjones.com [ 17-06-07 2338GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070617e36h000g3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
