\par\par \b \uc2 Dealers Say RBNZ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Market Early Mon   \b0\par\par\uc2 170 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 2007\par 00:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Monday to sell the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said.   \par \par \uc2 The apparent action from the RBNZ comes after last week's unprecedented \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  - the first since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated in 1985.   \par \par \uc2 "They (RBNZ) were in the market earlier, offering around the 75.50 (US) cent level," said Danica Hampton, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Bank of New Zealand.   \par \par \uc2 The New Zealand dollar has eased off to US$0.7523 from around US$0.7550 earlier this morning.   \par \par \uc2 Another dealer at HSBC said the RBNZ was seen offering in the high 75 U.S. cent area.   \par \par \uc2 He said the RBNZ appears determined to lean against any sustained uptrend in the Kiwi.   \par \par \uc2 The RBNZ last week said it sold the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  because the Kiwi was at unjustifiably high levels.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -Shri Navaratnam, Dow Jones Newswires; 64-4-471-5990; shri.navaratnam@dowjones.com \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 17-06-07 2217GMT ]   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070617e36h000f7\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdr